  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Greatsword infinite combo </Major>
    <Description>This combo was made for greatsword and is very situational and is not true combo , but is funny when you can hit all the combo.
I use the default keyboard and mouse keys of brawlhalla
AWSD- MOVE
M1 - ATTACK
M2- HEAVY ATTACK
SHIFT - DODGE

To the macro works you need to setup the keys like mine.

Im working to make that macro faster and better to reduce the dodge   windows of enemie and maybe make the combo become almost 1 true combo.

Test if you want and you can give me your feedback on my discord that is : Away#7646</Description>
